WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.934
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:03.269
I'm here with some
very special guests.

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.371
They just made history
as the first all-female group

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:07.539
from South Korea
to land on Billboard's

00:00:07.539 --> 00:00:10.243
on-demand streaming songs chart
with their hit song

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:12.212
"Sour Candy," with Lady Gaga.

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:16.382
Here is Jisoo, Lisa, Jennie, and
Rosé from BLACKPINK.

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:18.884
-Hi!
We're BLACKPINK.

00:00:18.884 --> 00:00:20.653
-Thank you so much
for being here.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:21.788
We are big fans.

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.823
You guys are awesome
for doing this.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:26.659
Let me give some quick stats
about you guys.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.162
You have had five
number-one singles

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:31.731
on the Billboard
world digital songs chart.

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:34.633
You're the most followed
girl group on Spotify

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:37.870
with over 21 million followers.

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:40.740
You are the most subscribed
music group on YouTube

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.776
with 37.3 million subscribers.

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:45.478
That is unbelievable.

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:49.248
And on Instagram,
you have 24.4 million followers.

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:50.717
That's major.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.919
Do you understand
how big that is?

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:55.154
-We literally don't.
It's like --

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:57.990
It makes us freeze
every time we hear this.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:01.560
It's -- We just thank our fans
so much for the love,

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.964
because, you know...
It's too much.

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:06.932
-Your first studio album
is coming out,

00:01:06.932 --> 00:01:08.801
and I am all about it.

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:11.271
Tonight, you are debuting
the first single off that album,

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.239
called "How You Like That?"

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:14.907
But before we get to that,
since you're here,

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:16.141
I want to play a game with you

00:01:16.141 --> 00:01:18.945
that is called the
Try Not to Laugh Challenge.

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:20.013
Here we go.

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:23.349
-Try not to laugh.
-Try not to laugh.

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:26.585
-Whatever you do,
please, try not to laugh.

00:01:26.585 --> 00:01:28.254
-The game is very simple.
I'm gonna show you

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.856
some funny videos,
and you have to try

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.990
to not laugh
while watching them.

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:34.694
If you can make it all the way
through without laughing,

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:36.128
you're gonna win that round.

00:01:36.128 --> 00:01:39.299
-Okay. Let's do it.
-All right. Here we go.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:42.268
Our first video.

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:43.269
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:46.606
-[ Speaking indistinctly ]

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.775
[ Kids screaming ]

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:49.909
-His teeth!

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:52.078
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:53.746
[ Dings ]

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:54.980
-Okay.
-Oh, no!

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:58.384
-Who laughed first?
-I think she did.

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:00.987
-She started
before the video started.

00:02:00.987 --> 00:02:04.323
-Jisoo, you laughed before
the video even started playing.

00:02:04.323 --> 00:02:06.459
-Yeah.
-She thought the screenshot

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:10.796
was just too funny to handle.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.796 --> 00:02:12.064
-All right.
Here we go.

00:02:12.064 --> 00:02:13.633
Video number two.
-Okay. We're ready.

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:15.335
-Oh, don't.

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:20.039
[ Dog barking melodically ]

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:23.576
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:25.111
-This has to be a voiceover.

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:26.713
-That was hard for me
'cause I've actually

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:29.582
seen that video before
on Instagram.

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:30.783
-Okay.

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:33.319
-But I think that is adorable.
I love that.

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.687
-It's a very close game so far.

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:36.823
Here we go.
Video number three.

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:38.691
-Okay.

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:39.725
-Jimmy Fallon.

00:02:39.725 --> 00:02:41.527
[ Triumphant music plays ]

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:43.896
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:45.231
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:48.133
[ Dings ]

00:02:48.133 --> 00:02:51.170
-Okay. I'm --
I'm not good at this game.

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:52.838
I'm just gonna say that.
She didn't laugh.

00:02:52.838 --> 00:02:54.140
She didn't laugh.
She won this.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:56.041
-Thank you
for not laughing at my face.

00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:58.544
I appreciate that.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.544 --> 00:03:00.380
-No! Like, the fact
that your face is --

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.949
-Seriously.
-You know, too excited.

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:05.451
-You can't do that to Jimmy.
We love Jimmy.

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.220
-For this last video, guys,
I'm not kidding.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:10.923
Whoever does not laugh
gets the bonus point round

00:03:10.923 --> 00:03:13.092
of 10,000 points
and will be the champion.

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:15.427
-Okay.
-Oh.

00:03:15.427 --> 00:03:17.096
-I'm gonna win this.
-Oh, no.

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:18.497
-Here we go.

00:03:18.497 --> 00:03:22.235
The last video.

00:03:22.235 --> 00:03:24.236
-Ooh.
Ooh!

00:03:24.236 --> 00:03:25.271
Ooh!

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:29.274
Aah!
Aah! Aah!

00:03:29.274 --> 00:03:31.243
Oh [bleep]

00:03:31.243 --> 00:03:32.078
[ Buzzer ]

00:03:32.078 --> 00:03:34.214
-One minute!

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:37.850
Okay.
Ain't no more, ain't no more.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:40.320
Okay, get the window!

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.589
Yo, let --
[ Buzzer ]

00:03:42.589 --> 00:03:44.691
[ Dings ]

00:03:44.691 --> 00:03:48.060
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:49.294
-I think we have a winner.

00:03:49.294 --> 00:03:51.630
-Oh!
She won!

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:54.133
-Takes the win!

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:55.668
BLACKPINK,
we love you guys so much.

00:03:55.668 --> 00:03:56.969
Congrats on the record.

00:03:56.969 --> 00:03:59.605
-Thank you so much for having us
on your show, Jimmy.

00:03:59.605 --> 00:04:01.173
-Congratulations.
Thanks for playing.

00:04:01.173 --> 00:04:03.042
Bye!
We love you guys.

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:05.211
-Bye!
See you soon! Bye!

